---
description: Core agent policy — brain OS, native tools, English, push guard, code quality.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` in the workspace root before acting. It is the source of truth for
advisor stance, brain memory protocol, tool routing, push guard, and planning thresholds.

**Brain:** run `brain load` at the start of each session to surface current state and
active tasks. Brain CLI: `~/.local/bin/brain`. Vault: `~/Vaults/Brain/Brains/<slug>/`.

**Tools:** native Read / Grep / Glob / Shell always. No lean-ctx, no headroom.

**RTK:** Cursor `preToolUse` hook rewrites supported Shell commands through `rtk`
(git, gh, docker, kubectl, pnpm, grep, test tools, etc.) for token-compressed output.
When running commands manually, prefer `rtk <command>` for matching subcommands.

**Language:** English. No Danish unless explicitly requested.

**Code quality:** aislop quality-gate hook is active — follow its feedback when it fires.
For JS/TS codebase analysis: fallow skill (`~/.agents/skills/fallow/SKILL.md`).
